│  ---                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ## 📅 **Day 1: Feb 14 – Art & Royal Splendor**                                                               │
│  ### 🌞 Morning                                                                                               │
│  - **8:00 AM**: Arrive at **Madrid-Barajas Airport**, transfer to **Hotel Ritz Madrid** (€130/night, 4-star,  │
│  central location).                                                                                           │
│  - **9:00 AM**: Start at **Prado Museum** (€15 entry). Prioritize *Las Meninas* and *The Garden of Earthly    │
│  Delights*.                                                                                                   │
│  - **12:30 PM**: Lunch at **Casa Botín** (120-year-old institution, *pulpo a la gallega*).                    │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ### 🍽️ Afternoon                                                                                              │
│  - **2:30 PM**: Explore **Royal Palace of Madrid** (€12 guided tour). Admire the Throne Room and Private      │
│  Apartments.                                                                                                  │
│  - **5:00 PM**: Stroll **Plaza Mayor**, grab *café con leche* at **Café de la Luna** (since 1790).            │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ### 🌃 Evening                                                                                               │
│  - **7:30 PM**: Dinner at **La Botica** (La Latina neighborhood) – try *croquetas* and *pimientos de          │
│  Padrón*.                                                                                                     │
│  - **9:30 PM**: Evening walk to **Casa de la Moneda** (Royal Mint) for panoramic views.                       │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ---                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ## 📅 **Day 2: Feb 15 – Modern Art & Hidden Gems**                                                           │
│  ### 🌞 Morning                                                                                               │
│  - **9:00 AM**: Visit **Reina Sofía Museum** (€15 entry). Focus on Picasso’s *Guernica* and Dali’s *The       │
│  Temptation of Saint Anthony*.                                                                                │
│  - **11:30 AM**: Break for **Cerralbo Museum** (Palacio de Cerralbo) – Spain’s largest private art            │
│  collection.                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ### 🍽️ Afternoon                                                                                              │
│  - **1:30 PM**: Lunch at **Mercado de San Miguel** (try *cocido madrileño* and *churros con chocolate*).      │
│  - **3:30 PM**: Explore **Lavapiés** street art. Visit **Centro Cultural La Gabilla** for local art.          │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ### 🌃 Evening                                                                                               │
│  - **6:00 PM**: Dinner at **Cervecería 1895** (Malasaña) – beer lover’s paradise謹.                           │
│  - **8:30 PM**: Evening tapas at **Casa Miguel** (Plaza Mayor).                                               │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ---                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ## 📅 **Day 3: Feb 16 – Cultural Immersion & Farewell**                                                      │
│  ### 🌞 Morning                                                                                               │
│  - **9:00 AM**: Walk to **Plaza Mayor**, visit **Casa de la Panadería** (historic bakery).                    │
│  - **11:00 AM**: Free entry to **Museo del Prado** on Sundays (check for exceptions).                         │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ### 🍽️ Afternoon                                                                                              │
│  - **1:00 PM**: Lunch at **Restaurante El Corte Inglés** (luxury dining with *espeto de bacalao*).            │
│  - **3:00 PM**: Transfer to **Madrid-Barajas Airport**.                                                       │
│                                                                                                               │
│  ---                                                                                                          │
